@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title AFTER MVP — SB-M07 — Read or deliberately send with truthful provider outcomes
actor User as U
participant "Provider connection" as C
participant "Message / draft context" as M
participant "Google Gmail (external)" as G
U -> C : Request intended read or reviewed send/reply
C -> C : Evaluate product and provider authority / account
alt Missing, revoked or wrong-context access
 C --> U : Denied / disconnected; no provider action
else Authorized future capability
 alt Read selected correspondence
  C -> G : Request permitted account / item context
  G --> M : Authorized data or bounded failure
  M -> M : Apply permitted safe-content / display rules
  M --> U : Permitted content / actual failure
 else Deliberate reviewed send or reply
  U -> M : Confirm sender, recipients, content and attachments
  M -> G : Submit only the permitted intended message
  alt Provider acceptance confirmed
   G --> M : Actual provider reference / confirmation
   M --> U : Provider accepted; delivery/read not established
  else Definite rejection / failure
   G --> M : Definite bounded rejection
   M --> U : Failed / rejected result
  else Ambiguous response / timeout
   M -> M : Retain unknown outcome and intended context
   M --> U : Unknown; reconcile before explicit retry
  end
 end
end
note over C,G
Logical future interaction. OAuth has not been created.
Reading, draft handling, sending and reply are distinct actions.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
